'''Mudkip''' (Japanese: '''ミズゴロウ''' ''Mizugorou'') is a {{ct|Water}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Promo-B}} series of cards.

